{"full":"RangiLyu/nanodet","name":"nanodet","description":"NanoDet-Plus⚡Super fast and lightweight anchor-free object detection model. 🔥Only 980 KB(int8) / 1.8MB (fp16) and run 97FPS on cellphone🔥","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":6273,"forks":1119,"created":"2020-10-19T08:36:25Z","updated":"2024-08-08T02:52:55Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["anchor-free","android","deep-learning","deep-neural-networks","efficientnet","mnn","model-zoo","nanodet","nanodet-plus","ncnn","object-detection","openvino","pytorch","repvgg","shufflenet"],"demo":"https://01.org/openvinotoolkit","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:17.286Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:17.286Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:17.286Z","technologies":["Python"],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T04:25:27.426Z","stars":6270,"forks":1119},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:05:08.898Z","stars":6271,"forks":1119},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:10:03.719Z","stars":6273,"forks":1119},{"at":"2026-10-07T11:14:17.286Z","stars":6273,"forks":1119}],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:45.380Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Super fast and high accuracy lightweight anchor-free object detection model. Real-time on mobile devices.","NanoDet is a FCOS-style one-stage anchor-free object detection model which using Generalized Focal Loss as classification and regression loss.","In NanoDet-Plus, we propose a novel label assignment strategy with a simple assign guidance module (AGM) and a dynamic soft label assigner (DSLA) to solve the optimal label assignment problem in lightweight model training. We also introduce a light feature pyramid called Ghost-PAN to enhance multi-layer feature fusion. These improvements boost previous NanoDet's detection accuracy by 7 mAP on COCO dataset."],"features":["⚡Super lightweight: Model file is only 980KB(INT8) or 1.8MB(FP16).","⚡Super fast: 97fps(10.23ms) on mobile ARM CPU.","👍High accuracy: Up to 34.3 mAPval@0.5:0.95 and still realtime on CPU.","🤗Training friendly: Much lower GPU memory cost than other models. Batch-size=80 is available on GTX1060 6G.","😎Easy to deploy: Support various backends including ncnn, MNN and OpenVINO. Also provide Android demo based on ncnn inference framework."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RangiLyu/nanodet/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9e3031d8e7ab6fe7f68a096a79bdd7f82ee7c4d06f5ba7d8eb763eea60fd0cb2","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:16:54.019Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:47.776Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-08-08T02:52:55Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:46.920Z","latestRelease":{"name":"NanoDet-Plus v1.0.0","tag":"v1.0.0","publishedAt":"2023-03-21T08:26:29Z","url":"https://github.com/RangiLyu/nanodet/releases/tag/v1.0.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:46.920Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/64b84570d381a90153b3a2dc.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-04T10:39:02.488Z","url":"https://01.org/openvinotoolkit"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://01.org/openvinotoolkit","attemptedAt":"2026-10-04T10:39:02.488Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T10:39:02.488Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-04T10:39:02.488Z","target":"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/topic-technology/open/overview.html","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-11T10:39:02.488Z"},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Super fast and high accuracy lightweight anchor-free object detection model. Real-time on mobile devices.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RangiLyu/nanodet/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9e3031d8e7ab6fe7f68a096a79bdd7f82ee7c4d06f5ba7d8eb763eea60fd0cb2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RangiLyu/nanodet/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:47.776Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RangiLyu/nanodet/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:19:21.520Z","hash":"9e3031d8e7ab6fe